### Quick booking tips
| Tip | Why it matters |
|-----|----------------|
| **Reserve early** | Prices for Hollywood hotels climb quickly as the holiday season approaches. |
| **Free‑cancellation rooms** | Most of the hotels above allow free cancellation up to 48 h before arrival – useful if your plans change. |
| **Loyalty programs** | If you belong to a major chain (Marriott, Hilton, IHG, etc.), you can earn points or often receive a complimentary upgrade, especially at the Hollywood Roosevelt and Hollywood Plaza. |
| **Check the “pay‑at‑hotel” option** | Some properties (e.g., Hollywood Guesthouse) let you pay on arrival, which can be handy if you’re budgeting. |
| **Ask about shuttle/trolley services** | The Hollywood Hotel and Hollywood Plaza both run complimentary shuttles to the Walk of Fame and nearby Metro stations. |

